00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:13.680
David asked God to create in me a clean heart,&nbsp;
God, and renew a steadfast spirit within me.&nbsp;

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:19.020
[Psalm 51:10]
One of the most famous men in the Bible who had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:26.160
an unbelievable relationship with God was David.
He was a man after God's own heart.&nbsp;

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:31.020
How many men who call themselves&nbsp;
Christians can say that today?&nbsp;

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:36.300
How many men ask God the same&nbsp;
request that David asked?&nbsp;

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:41.220
How many men are really serious&nbsp;
about their relationship with God?&nbsp;

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:48.240
How many men know God intimately?
I believe that all of us men should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:55.320
have this deep burning desire to have a deep&nbsp;
relationship with God the way David did.&nbsp;

00:02:55.920 --> 00:03:00.300
David walked closely with God.
And we still learn from his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:08.280
life today, thousands of years later.
He had an unstoppable desire to know the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:12.840
God of all creation intimately.
Not just know about Him.&nbsp;

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:20.040
This 90-day devotional was created&nbsp;
to help us to deeply know God.&nbsp;

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:29.940
Each devotional is a guide to grow closer to God&nbsp;
and learn what it means to truly abide in Christ.&nbsp;

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:36.060
I believe thousands of Christian men&nbsp;
today are lukewarm and they do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:40.260
realize that God will spit them out of His mouth.&nbsp;

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:47.880
There's a big problem in the church today.
A problem of lukewarm men who care more about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:52.860
living for the things of this world than&nbsp;
about living for the God of this world.&nbsp;

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:58.920
The gospel messages we hear in many churches&nbsp;
across the globe are often sensational,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:06.840
superficial, and materialistic.
We hear a watered-down gospel aimed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:13.560
at tickling ears instead of transforming&nbsp;
lives and saving souls for Christ.&nbsp;

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:22.380
I wrote this book to cut through all the noise&nbsp;
and bring back the sound doctrine of scripture.&nbsp;

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:29.460
I want to do so in truth and love, pointing&nbsp;
men across the world to pick up their cross&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:33.300
and follow Jesus.
To respect Him.&nbsp;

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:38.100
To understand His holiness.
To seek Him and His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:45.900
righteousness first, in everything they do.
Bold Pursuit calls us to radical discipleship&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:51.540
which can only come from wholehearted&nbsp;
devotion to Jesus Christ.&nbsp;

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:58.140
I will turn to the Bible and teach spiritual&nbsp;
truths that will help us understand what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:06.840
it means to truly abide in Christ and to&nbsp;
fully surrender to His will for our lives.&nbsp;

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:14.580
This is what we need in the church today.
You cannot serve Christ with only your heart&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.400
or only your mind.
You need both.&nbsp;

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:23.700
In other words, you need to follow Christ&nbsp;
with the right doctrine and devotion.&nbsp;

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:32.220
You also need to know what it means to follow&nbsp;
Christ in the spirit and not in the flesh.&nbsp;

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:38.460
God has called me to share the&nbsp;
good news to the ends of the world.&nbsp;

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:45.480
To all people and all nations.
To teach the Word in season and out of season.&nbsp;

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:51.240
And to show people what it&nbsp;
means to be a reborn Christian.&nbsp;

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.800
My heart for this book is&nbsp;
that men around the world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.180 --> 00:06:04.020
will come to understand that the God of the past&nbsp;
is the same God of the present and the future.&nbsp;

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:09.780
We can have a relationship&nbsp;
with him like David had.&nbsp;

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:17.880
We can read and study His unchanging truth&nbsp;
in the Bible, in the same way Godly men did.&nbsp;

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.360
Men like John Wesley.
Charles Spurgeon.&nbsp;

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.700
Jonathan Edwards.
D.L Moody.&nbsp;

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.860
Billy Graham.
Andrew Murray.&nbsp;

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.880
And my father, Etienne&nbsp;
Maritz, here in South Africa.&nbsp;

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:37.500
Bold Pursuit will change us to look in&nbsp;
the mirror, to examine whether we are in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:43.560
the faith and whether we follow Christ&nbsp;
with our whole heart, mind, and soul.&nbsp;

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:47.880
This book will require a new and fresh commitment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:52.560
to God and a burning desire to&nbsp;
please Him in all that we do.&nbsp;

00:06:53.520 --> 00:07:02.220
Most of us do not realize that God is more eager&nbsp;
to love us and answer our prayers than we are to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:08.580
