God is always waiting.&nbsp;

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:15.300
The God of the universe is&nbsp;
always there waiting for us.&nbsp;

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:21.960
God is more eager to reveal himself&nbsp;
to us than we are to seek Him.&nbsp;

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:28.080
Wow.
It is time we turn back to God fully.&nbsp;

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:34.020
